{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19281","headline":"奉和裴令公新成绿野堂即书 · 刘禹锡","name":"奉和裴令公新成绿野堂即书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蔼蔼鼎门外，澄澄洛水湾。\n堂皇临绿野，坐卧看青山。\n位极却忘贵，功成欲爱闲。\n官名司管龠，心术去机关。\n禁苑凌晨出，园花及露攀。\n池塘鱼拔刺，竹迳鸟绵蛮。\n志在安潇洒，尝经历险艰。\n高情方造适，衆意望徵还。\n好客交珠履，华筵舞玉颜。\n无因随贺燕，翔集画梁间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19281.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19281","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}